Two specs govern this repo. Read both before structural work.
- benedict-daily-spec.md — design system, Benedict portal, content pipeline
- portals-spec.md — portal abstraction, cadence rules, per-saint specs

portals-spec.md v2 supersedes benedict-daily-spec.md where they conflict.
Notably: the "no start-a-plan onboarding" rule is scoped to Benedict, not the app.

Non-negotiable: EB Garamond for all reading text, sans confined to chrome.
Never compute or display a reading backlog. No streak counters.